# ============================================================
# A. URL encoding — likely fixable by trying alt URL pattern
# ============================================================
# Batches 01/02 discovered BG-wiki uses these patterns:
#   - Apostrophes:  literal '  OR  %27-encoded (BG-wiki accepts both)
#   - [S] campaign: (S)  with parens, NOT brackets
#   - Dynamis:      Dynamis_-_<ZoneName>  (underscore-hyphen-underscore)
# Apply the same patterns to retry these:

288_Escha_ZiTah.json            try: Escha_-_Zi%27Tah  or  Escha_-_Zi'Tah
289_Escha_RuAun.json            try: Escha_-_Ru%27Aun  or  Escha_-_Ru'Aun
